{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "a1111111-1111-4111-8001-000000000001",
    "name": "01 - Salesforce QA",
    "description": "BSG workspace — Salesforce REST **read-first** samples.\n\n## Auth\nSet `sf_access_token` from **00 - Auth & Tokens** (JWT/OAuth) or paste a token for debugging.\n\n## Variables (environment)\n- `sf_base_url` — e.g. https://instance--qa.sandbox.my.salesforce.com\n- `sf_api_version` — e.g. v59.0\n- `sf_access_token` — Bearer token\n\n## Monitor policy\nFolders **1** and **2** are intended read-only smoke. Folder **3** runs SOQL (read-only).",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{sf_access_token}}", "type": "string" }]
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "sf_api_version", "value": "v59.0", "type": "string" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. Health & connectivity",
      "description": "Lightweight calls to confirm token and API reachability.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "GET API versions (root)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": "{{sf_base_url}}/services/data/"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "GET Organization limits",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": "{{sf_base_url}}/services/data/{{sf_api_version}}/limits"
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "2. Read-only smoke",
      "description": "Safe for scheduled monitors if token is valid and policy allows.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "GET Global describe (sobjects)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": "{{sf_base_url}}/services/data/{{sf_api_version}}/sobjects/"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "GET Account describe",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": "{{sf_base_url}}/services/data/{{sf_api_version}}/sobjects/Account/describe"
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "3. Query (SOQL) — read-only",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "GET Query — Account LIMIT 1",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{sf_base_url}}/services/data/{{sf_api_version}}/query?q=SELECT+Id,Name+FROM+Account+LIMIT+1",
              "host": ["{{sf_base_url}}"],
              "path": ["services", "data", "{{sf_api_version}}", "query"],
              "query": [{ "key": "q", "value": "SELECT Id,Name FROM Account LIMIT 1" }]
            }
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
